        "name": "NeoTech",
        "email": "andreas@roughedge.se",
        "date": "2026-11-21T20:24:31Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(post): refuse a non-finite wire number in wire-iso by name\n\nA PARAM WireTaper, WirePlane, WireAngle, WireU or WireV that is not a\nfinite number (null, nan, inf) was skipped without a word, so a leaning\nmove posted as a plain G1 X Y. The script now refuses it by name and\nwrites no cut of the section.\n\nFixes #3236\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
